[engl]
{100}{}{Kalnor}
{200}{}{Kalnor, a Junktown guard.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Armed}
{1020}{}{Disarmed}
{1030}{}{Night}
{2000}{}{I dunno about that. You might want to check with Killian. He's to the north. That's up that way, OK?@@Oh, heck. The place for that is Darkwater's. Killian runs it. It's a little to the north. Killian has the best supplies in town.}
{2010}{}{Thanks, bye.}
{3000}{}{Welcome to Junktown. What can I do for you?}
{3010}{}{What are you doing here? What is this place?}
{3020}{}{Where can I get some supplies?}
{3030}{}{Nothing, thanks.}
{3040}{}{Wa-wa!}
{4000}{}{What does it look like? I'm a guard, and I'm keeping an eye out for strangers like you. And this place is called Junktown. Hey, don't laugh. I happen to like the name myself. We mostly do trading. Sometimes we trade with those stuck up bastards from Hub. Hey, you're not from the Hub are you?}
{4010}{}{What? The Hub? Sure I am!}
{4020}{}{Me? No, I'm not from the Hub.}
{5000}{}{Then you must know most of the rules. Have a good day. And I am sorry about the bastards part, OK?}
{5010}{}{Yeah! Hey, no problem. Bye.}
{5020}{}{It's going to cause me some severe mental trauma. Later.}
{6000}{}{You'd better put that away. Junktown is a friendly place, friend, and we want to keep it that way.@@Hey you, no weapons! And I don't care if your momma dropped you on our head as a kid. No weapons.}
{6010}{}{Put what away?}
{6020}{}{Don't tell me what to do, loser boy.}
{6030}{}{Sounds fair. By the way, what is the local law regarding weapons?}
{6040}{}{Uh, oh.}
{7000}{}{Your weapon, idiot. Killian won't take your arms away, but you'd better damn well keep them in your holster.}
{7010}{}{No way! I'm not putting down my shooters for nobody!}
{7020}{}{Oh, sorry.}
{8000}{}{You'd better behave, since it's the law, and I enforce the law. Put your weapon away. Don't draw it unless in self-defense and you won't have a problem with us guards. Disobey the law and we will return you to the lawless wasteland--dead or alive.}
{8010}{}{Sure, since you put it that way.}
{8020}{}{Well, uh, fine with me. But you'd better be careful.}
{8030}{}{Bite your laws!}
{9000}{}{Good you asked. No weapons can be drawn except in self-defense. If you start a fight, it's your fault. Other than that, it's your right to go around armed. Just don't pull a knife or gun without just cause. Have a good day.}
{9010}{}{Thanks, bye.}
{10000}{}{I'm sorry, the gates are closed for the night. Come back in the morning.}
{10010}{}{Hey, I need to get in!}
{10020}{}{No problem. See you in the morning.}
{10030}{}{I'm sorry to disturb you, sir, but I would like to enter your town. You can see that I would cause no harm.}
{10040}{}{Hunh-huh!}
{11000}{}{Sorry, the rules are the rules. No strangers admitted during the night.}
{12000}{}{Well, I shouldn't do this, but you seem like a nice enough person. Come on in, but don't make any trouble.}
{13000}{}{Come . . . back . . . day . . .}

